into units.amni
use os, math
dialect js

`SYS` = "us", or "si" if file `amnicad.sys` holds "si" (trimmed). `sys()` -> SYS. `set_sys(s)`: SYS = s=="si" ? "si" : "us", then try writing SYS to that file.

`MM_PER`: in 25.4, mm 1. `doc_units(u)`: u=="in" ? "in" : "mm". `mm_per(u)` = MM_PER[doc_units(u)].

`nf(v real, d int = -1)` -> new string: "—" if not finite, else JS `(+v.toFixed(d)||0).toLocaleString('en-US',{maximumFractionDigits:d})`; d=-1 means by |v|: ≥1000 0, ≥100 1, ≥10 2, ≥1 3, ≥0.01 4, else 5.

Struct `Unit { label const byte[:], factor real, offset real }`. `unit_entry(q, s)` -> Unit, aborts "unknown quantity" for unknown q. Per q: si label factor; us label factor [offset]:
- len: mm 1; in 1/25.4
- area: mm² 1; in² 1/645.16
- vol: cm³ 1e-3; in³ 1/16387.064
- mass: kg 1; lb 2.2046226
- force: N 1; lbf 0.22480894
- press, stress: MPa 1; psi 145.03774
- modulus: GPa 1e-3; Msi 1.4503774e-4
- torque: N·mm 1; lbf·in 0.0088507458
- temp: °C 1; °F 1.8 offset 32
- dtemp: K 1; °F 1.8
- power: W 1; BTU/hr 3.4121416
- film: W/m²K 1; BTU/hr·ft²·°F 0.17611016
- cond: W/m·K 1; BTU/hr·ft·°F 0.57782155
- speed: m/s 1; mph 2.2369363
- dens: kg/m³ 1; lb/in³ 3.6127292e-5
- accel: m/s² 1; ft/s² 3.2808399
- freq: Hz 1; Hz 1
- pa: Pa 1; psf 0.020885434

With u = unit_entry(q, s): `conv(q, v, s)` = v*u.factor + u.offset; `back(q, v, s)` = (v - u.offset)/u.factor; `unit_of(q, s = SYS)` = u.label; `to_si(q, v)` = back(q, v, SYS); `from_si(q, v)` = conv(q, v, SYS).

`one(q, v, s = SYS, d = -1)` -> new string: nf(conv(q, v, s), d) + " " + unit_of(q, s). `dual(q, v, d = -1)`: one(q, v, SYS, d) + " (" + one(q, v, other system, d) + ")".
